      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "The arithmetic constant is not guessed from the global sum. It emerges by choosing coordinates that isolate parity and express the rest as multiplicative local data, then translating average order into the particular logarithmic weights demanded by the analytic problem.",
